  "description": "The two records that pass through the writer at their full width, and the five that do not. TRANSACTION-HEADER-2 is declared PIC X(133) VALUE ALL '-' in app/cpy/CVTRA07Y.cpy, so it is already the record width app/jcl/TRANREPT.jcl:78 declares and reaches TRANREPT unpadded - 133 hyphens, no space anywhere; and WS-BLANK-LINE is PIC X(133) VALUE SPACES at :133, so it passes through as 133 spaces. The other five layouts are narrower and are right-space-padded to 133 by the writer: REPORT-NAME-HEADER 115, TRANSACTION-HEADER-1 114, TRANSACTION-DETAIL-REPORT 114, and REPORT-PAGE-TOTALS and REPORT-GRAND-TOTALS 112 each. Pinning every record as whole bytes is what makes each of those widths assertable.",
